Nuntia
https://coatimundiapps.github.io/nuntia.html

What is Nuntia?
Nuntia is a lightweight, modern mail client built with Python + GTK3, designed to feel at home on Deepin. It focuses on speed, a clean interface, and the features you actually use every day.

✨ Key features
IMAP/SMTP support for any provider (Gmail, iCloud, Outlook, custom domains…)

Conversation threading – group emails by thread

Labels with colors and per-label counters

Automatic filters – move, label, or mark emails as read based on rules

Phishing detection – built-in analysis of suspicious emails

Per-account signatures

Multi-account with a unified inbox

Spam filter – block or allow senders

8 languages: 🇫🇷 FR, 🇬🇧 EN, 🇩🇪 DE, 🇪🇸 ES, 🇯🇵 JA, 🇵🇹 PT, 🇹🇭 TH, 🇨🇳 ZH

Dark mode following the system theme

Native Deepin integration – follows your accent color

website : https://coatimundiapps.github.io/
